#
# STM32F746G Discovery board sdcard modules - board-specific modules for sdcard
#
#
# The car HMI demo (choco-technologies/carhmi-demo): a service that claims the display for its view and plays the MP3
# files of the card's music/ directory through dmaudio. The module is loaded by name from /mnt/<label>/bin, once
# automount has mounted the card, so the unit (carhmi.ini, which goes to the firmware's /configs - dmf-get puts the
# service= files there for the sdcard modules too) can only start after that. Its dependencies (dmmp3, dmimg, ...) come
# with it into the same bin.
#
carhmi service=carhmi.ini
#
# The car HMI's view (carhmi.dmv with its fonts and images, ~320 kB - too big for the flash): installed to
# build/sdcard/views/carhmi_view/, it goes to <card>/views/carhmi_view/ (upload-files), where carhmi.ini looks for it.
#
carhmi_view
#
# The decoders of the album covers carhmi makes of the MP3 files' pictures: dmimg finds them by name, so they are not
# in carhmi's dependencies.
#
dmimg_jpeg
dmimg_png
